# Decision Template
Purpose:
  Decision Template


Decision: DEC-000
Type: architectural|technical|security|business|operational|human|ai
Status: proposed

Title: {One-line decision title}

Context:
  {Background, why this decision is needed}

Problem:
  {Specific problem statement}

Options:
  1. {Option A}
     Pros:
       - {pro}
     Cons:
       - {con}
     Cost: {estimate}

  2. {Option B}
     Pros:
       - {pro}
     Cons:
       - {con}
     Cost: {estimate}

  3. {No change}
     Pros:
       - {pro}
     Cons:
       - {con}
     Cost: {estimate}

Decision:
  {Chosen option}

Rationale:
  {Why this option over others}

Impact:
  Files: [list]
  Modules: [list]
  Risks: [R0-R5 list]

Owner: <human or agent>
Reviewers: [list]

Approved_By: null
Approved_At: null

Implementation:
  Tasks: [TASK ids]
  Chain: <chain type>
  Status: pending

Verification:
